WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:04,940
If that young man kills my kingdom people

2
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,940
Who dares to kill me

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,420
Zheng Rail Bureau Qinshan

4
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,740
You are so cruel

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,580
I have worked hard for the bureau for thirty years

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,660
The blood shed is more than the water you drink.

7
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,260
Just for a security guard watching the door

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,780
He took me to Zheng Railway Bureau

9
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,500
It also abolished the weirdness that I controlled

10
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,540
Like throwing away garbage

11
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,900
Leave me here to die

12
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,700
Qin Ting, I know I was wrong

13
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,500
Please let me go this time

14
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,220
Let me kowtow to my distant predecessors

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,620
You can be a cow or a horse

16
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,060
Offended the distant senior

17
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,740
How can an apology be enough to offset it?
